l2 were dissolved in n-octanol (presaturated with water) and then combined with an equal volume of deionized water (presaturated with octanol). The mixed solution was strongly shaken for 2 h and then centrifuged for 15 min to remove undissolved complexes and achieve complete phase separation. The concentrations of complexes in the two phases were determined through the standard working equation using UV-vis spectroscopy. The logP values were measured using the formula logP = log(Coctanol/Cwater)"}]}